src/management.rs adapts the purge transaction shape from Nous-Wave
crates/memory/src/service/lifecycle.rs, commit
412b062082afb75ccfae4c3f69fc606d3e3cc862, Apache-2.0.
The SQLite implementation preserves minimal purge markers and audit identity,
redacts derived model output and receipt copies, and invalidates projections.

src/embeddings.rs adapts source/space validation and authority publication from
Nous-Wave crates/retrieval/src/embedding.rs, commit
412b062082afb75ccfae4c3f69fc606d3e3cc862, Apache-2.0.
The SQLite implementation shares the model call ledger and commit transaction,
stores scoped vectors, and retains source hashes for content-equivalent reuse.

src/transaction.rs adapts the receipt/transaction envelope from
Nous-Wave crates/persistence/src/mutations.rs, commit
412b062082afb75ccfae4c3f69fc606d3e3cc862, Apache-2.0.
The SQLite implementation adds namespace scoping, complete receipt replay,
one database-wide commit sequence, and apalis jobs in the same connection.

src/structured.rs adapts exact scoped revision binding, revision creation and
source dependency traversal from Nous-Wave crates/persistence/src/references.rs
and crates/memory/src/service/{provenance.rs,episode/mutation.rs,
journal/mutations.rs,schema/mutation.rs}, commit
412b062082afb75ccfae4c3f69fc606d3e3cc862, Apache-2.0.
The SQLite implementation shares one scoped revision owner, typed payloads,
independent evidence edges, exact history and deduplicated source roots.

Queue integration adapts apalis-sqlite src/persist.rs and examples/basic.rs,
commit 9c87189360b0e212b23821a1a177e9cbe2ad1d4a, MIT.
Its license is retained in LICENSE.apalis.
Migrations run through SQLx's Migrator rather than upstream setup() so that
Nous keeps synchronous=FULL on every connection.
